OL,5,G1800 Kirstie and Phil's Love It or...  
OL,6,     F...List It: In Newtownards, Amy   
OL,7,     Fand Brian are at loggerheads over 
OL,8,     Ftheir five-bed chalet bungalow.   
OL,9,     FCan Kirstie make it feel like new 
OL,10,     Fagain, or will the grass be       
OL,11,     Fgreener elsewhere?                
OL,12,G1900 George Clarke's Building Home     
OL,13,     FIn Radcliffe-on-Trent, Joel and   
OL,14,     FNicola restore Joel's             
OL,15,     Fgrandparents' 1970s Victorian     
OL,16,     Fcottage and add a plush extension,
OL,17,     Fwith a stretched budget and a     
OL,18,     Ftight Yuletide timeline.          
